less</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#The_Epic_Desert&#39;s_Biting_Sands\" title=\"Named item sets\">The Epic Desert's Biting Sands</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#The_Epic_Desert&#39;s_Biting_Sands\" title=\"Named item sets\">The Epic Desert's Biting Sands</a>:</b> 2 Pieces Equipped:<br />+4% Artifact bonus to Force Spellcrit Chance<br />+20 Artifact bonus to Force Spellpower<br />+20 Artifact bonus to Magical Resistance Rating Cap</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Epic_Staff_of_Arcane_Power.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Epic_Staff_of_Arcane_Power.png/420px-Epic_Staff_of_Arcane_Power.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"963\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Epic_Staff_of_Arcane_Power.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Legendary_Crafting\" title=\"Legendary Crafting\">Legendary Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Legendary_Staff_of_Arcane_Power\" title=\"Item:Legendary Staff of Arcane Power\">Legendary Staff of Arcane Power</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>This staff began as a ceremonial weapon created by the gnoll